      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraawo a gár hariimaaká barwá ngiwa gooiim amorhúngií alé as daanduú ohmeedá' ta haniisi tawa alee/isoó múk hhohhó' oo Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng a xuú' adór kuungá' muuná kur koondá' oo alee/isaywí kuwa hanisa'. Slám án kuungá' nuna xirfayeés dír geeraá múk yaamaá Makedoniár i alé gawaá kaangwihe, niwa oó', «Múk Akaya tina amohhe'eés alee/isaay haniisaro iimír kurkú /isá'.» Muunaáhúng kwisíng múk yaariír baraaine gwaa ilakaaharuú i qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala án hamí hhaeeká' ngin ya/aáw as axweesanayrén kudá' atén kuungá' nuwa xirfayeemiisaán gawaá kaangwihe, miwa axweesanoó tawo tleehhiít, ala masók a kuungá' tina amohhe'esé' adoodá' kara kaahaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma múk Makedonia barnaxes nee aníng naa al hardahaán, adór kuungá' tara hhe'eesi'iiká kari ar, atén daqaní aga muruutaán as adoodá' kuungá' nuwa haraxuaán. Ala mureerí a tooín kiloseká, ala tam kuungá' sleeme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe aníng ana ár, a gár afhhamít hhaeeká' ngiwa firiim iwa giirina' hardahamu amorhunge, as alee/isaywí kuwa amohhe'esa', kudá' kuungá' naa qaroó al'axwesé' haniisaro. Asma alee/isayhúng barnaxes ngwa qaroó amohhe'esé' qoomár án binda hardáh, gár i laqaqaan a kuungá' kiloohúng ana slaé' kawa hanisa', nee a qahaángwár hanmisa'aaká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' adoorí inslawaak, «Heé dahaasíngw niiná qamiím, inós bu'úngw i slay sleeme ku niiná. Nee heé dahaasíngw yaariír qamiím, inós bu'úngw i slay sleeme ku úr.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuúqo heewo gár kuwa hariím a inós kilós gan aldaakw baraá muunaáwós i alé áx gár i haniisi a milá. Daqaní gadá' ngi haniisi ar sla'aarirós ar kilá', ala ar /uurutisarooká. Asma heé hanmiís ar qwal/amaaye, inós ku slaa' nee Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee Mungú i aleesleemuú kón oo kuungá' nuwa tsuuqi ar yaareema ar umuúqo loohiro. Adoorí gan tleehh as kuungá' umuúqo deeloro nee baraá umuúqo loohiro masók mura' sleémeero u koondá', kudá' ta sla'a' baraá slafingwhunge. Nee slám a muruudá' kuungá' ta sla'a' kiloseeká, ala dirhunge in tlaahh, as kuungá' kawa aleesleera' umuúqo gadiyér hho' kawa alee/isa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Gooi i kat,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
